ty Leads We’re looking for a highly analytical and self-driven PPC professional with a performance marketing mindset to lead and scale our paid search campaigns for motivated seller leads in the real estate investment space. You’ll join a high-growth US-based company with a product that’s alr\"><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Marketing Manager For Paid Search (Google Ads, Bing Ads) | REMOTE at Property Leads\"><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Property Leads We’re looking for a highly analytical and self-driven PPC professional with a performance marketing mindset to lead and scale our paid search campaigns for motivated seller leads in the real estate investment space. You’ll join a high-growth US-based company with a product that’s alr\"><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://property-leads.breezy.hr/p/75c165e6d311-marketing-manager-for-paid-search-google-ads-bing-ads-remote/social/image?linkedin=1773844714152\"><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Breezy_HR\"><meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Company\"><meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"Property Leads\"><meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Location\"><meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Mexico\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Breezy HR\",\"alternateName\":\"Breezy HR: Modernize your recruiting process\",\"url\":\"https://breezy.hr/\"}\n</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org/\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"url\":\"https://property-leads.breezy.hr/p/75c165e6d311-marketing-manager-for-paid-search-google-ads-bing-ads-remote?source=GoogleJobs\",\"title\":\"Marketing Manager For Paid Search (Google Ads, Bing Ads) | REMOTE\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Property Leads</strong></p> <p><strong>We’re looking for a highly analytical and self-driven PPC professional</strong> with a <strong>performance marketing mindset</strong> to lead and scale our <strong>paid search campaigns</strong> for motivated seller leads in the real estate investment space.</p> <p>You’ll join a high-growth US-based company with a product that’s already generating significant revenue—and you’ll have full ownership of PPC strategy, execution, and budget.</p> <p><strong>About the Role</strong></p> <ul><li>Manage, scale, and optimize PPC campaigns on Google and Bing </li><li>Work with high-intent keywords and high CPCs in an ultra-competitive vertical</li><li>Prioritize ROAS and <strong>backend lead quality</strong> (not just form submissions)</li><li>Set up A/B tests on ads, keywords, landing pages, and bidding strategies</li><li>Use tools like Google Ads Editor, CallRail, Zapier, Looker Studio, and CRM integrations</li><li>Work Autonomously - monitor, analyze, and proactively troubleshoot campaign performance without needing prompts</li></ul> <p><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p> <ul><li>4+ years of hands-on PPC experience (lead gen, not e-commerce)</li><li>Experience managing <strong>$10k–$100k+ monthly ad budgets</strong></li><li><strong>Strong track record of scaling lead-gen campaigns in competitive markets</strong></li><li><strong>Familiar with lead tracking, CRMs, UTM strategies, and funnel analytics</strong></li><li><strong>Data-driven, ROI-obsessed, self-directed, and focused on measurable impact</strong></li><li><strong>Proactive problem-solver who seeks out inefficiencies and resolves them independently</strong></li><li><strong>Fluent English</strong></li></ul> <p><strong>Bonus Points</strong></p> <ul><li>Real estate, home services, or motivated seller lead-gen experience</li><li>CRO / landing page testing and optimization experience</li><li>Experience using automation or scripts to improve ad performance</li></ul> <p><strong>What You’ll Get</strong></p> <ul><li>Full-time, <strong>remote-first</strong> role (flexible hours)</li><li>Direct impact on growth and marketing decisions</li><li>Lean, fast-moving team—no red tape</li><li>Competitive compensation with performance upside</li></ul> <p></p> <p>If you’re a <strong>PPC expert who thrives on performance and ownership</strong>, we’d love to meet you.</p>\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"datePosted\":\"2025-05-12\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Property Leads\",\"logo\":null,\"sameAs\":\"https://property-leads.breezy.hr\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressCountry\":\"MX\"}},\"validThrough\":\"2026-03-18T14:38:34.135Z\",\"jobLocationType\":\"TELECOMMUTE\",\"applicantLocationRequirements\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"MX\"}}\n</script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://platform-api.sharethis.com/js/sharethis.js#property=643ef4e9c1f1cd00199ca696&amp;product=sop\" async=\"async\"></script><link rel=\"image_src\" href=\"https://property-leads.breezy.hr/p/75c165e6d311-marketing-manager-for-paid-search-google-ads-bing-ads-remote/social/image?linkedin=1773844714152\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://assets-cdn.breezy.hr/breezy-portal/javascripts/v3/polyglot.min.js?v=2bq-1us5ftb\"></script><script id=\"translateScript\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://assets-cdn.breezy.hr/breezy-portal/javascripts/v3/translate.breezy.js?v=awfw-ecrhol\"></script><script>// INDEED OAUTH FLOW\nvar popup;\nvar breezyUrl=\"https://app.breezy.hr\"\nvar positionId=\"75c165e6d311\"\n\nfunction popupParams () {\n    var height = 600;\n    var width = 500;\n    var left = (window.screen.width / 2) - ((width / 2) + 10);\n    var top = (window.screen.height / 2) - ((height / 2) + 50);\n\n    var params = 'status=no,height=' + height + ',width=' + width + ',resizable=yes,left=' + left + ',top=' + top + ',screenX=' + left + ',screenY=' + top + ',toolbar=no,menubar=no,scrollbars=no,location=no,directories=no';\n\n    return params;\n}\nfunction oAuthListener (msg) {\n    let url = window.location.href\n  